  orderBubbles:
  - My brother overate at the harvest feast.
  - His stomach is bloated, heavy, and blocked.
  - His body also retains too much water.
  - He drinks freely, and no pregnant patient is involved.
  - My notes prescribe Taraxacum officinale for excess water.
  - They add Foeniculum vulgare for blocked digestion.
  firstHerbId: herb.dandelion
  secondHerbId: herb.fennel
